{"at":"2026-10-05T09:46:49.226Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"IndexedDB 不支持 Boolean 作为索引键，必须采用内存过滤或映射为整数 (0/1) 索引。","content":"W3C Indexed Database API 3.0: 规范明确定义合法键（Keys）的类型仅包含 number, date, string, binary, array；布尔值（Boolean）不是合法键类型，尝试将其他 ECMAScript 值转换为键将失败。因此在 IndexedDB/Dexie 中不能对 isPinned/isFavorite 等布尔字段直接建立索引或执行 where('isPinned').equals(true)。","scope":"technical.indexeddb_key_types","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording IndexedDB key types evidence","toolSummary":"Record IndexedDB keys evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":112,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:46:59.935Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"ESM 前端应用无法直接通过 file:// 协议运行，必须部署于 HTTP/HTTPS 或 localhost 服务环境中。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确指出：在本地测试中，如果尝试直接通过本地文件加载（即使用 file:// URL），由于 JavaScript 模块的安全与同源策略要求，浏览器会抛出 CORS 跨域错误。必须通过 Web 服务器提供服务。","scope":"technical.deployment_file_cors","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Modules"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording ESM file CORS evidence","toolSummary":"Record ESM CORS evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":114,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:47:04.661Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"Service Worker 仅支持 HTTPS 与 localhost 安全上下文，且断网冷重启依赖已激活的 Service Worker 缓存，与已打开页面的内存/存储离线操作有本质前提区别。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确说明：Service workers 仅在安全上下文 (Secure Contexts，即 HTTPS 或 http://localhost) 中可用；在普通非安全 HTTP 或 file:// 环境下无法注册。Service Worker 负责拦截网络请求和管理静态资源离线缓存，应用在离线重新打开（冷重启）必须依赖已安装并激活的 Service Worker，而首次访问或未注册前无法离线打开。","scope":"technical.service_worker_offline","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Service_Worker_API"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording Service Worker evidence","toolSummary":"Record Service Worker evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":116,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:47:07.493Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"sessionStorage 受标签页生命周期约束且存在配额/禁用异常，不可承诺关闭标签页后草稿 100% 恢复，必须设计手动导出与错误隔离。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确说明：sessionStorage 作用域限定于当前浏览上下文（标签页），页面刷新可保留数据，但关闭标签页或窗口时会话结束并彻底清除数据；在不支持持久化或被用户禁用的隐私策略下会抛出 SecurityError，空间超限时抛出 QuotaExceededError。未保存草稿无法保证跨标签页关闭恢复。","scope":"technical.session_storage_lifecycle","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sessionStorage"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording sessionStorage lifecycle evidence","toolSummary":"Record sessionStorage evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":118,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:47:10.764Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"persist() 授权取决于浏览器策略且仅限安全上下文，无官方 detectPrivateMode API，无痕模式与驱逐防护需如实声明边界。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确说明：StorageManager.persist() 仅在安全上下文 (HTTPS) 中可用，返回的 Promise 解析为布尔值代表是否被授予持久化权限，浏览器根据内部规则自主决定是否授权；规范未定义全浏览器通用的 detectPrivateMode API，隐私/无痕模式下的行为因浏览器而异且无法 100% 靠标准 API 检测。","scope":"technical.storage_persist_privacy","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/StorageManager/persist"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording StorageManager persist evidence","toolSummary":"Record persist evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":120,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:47:15.793Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"Web SPA 快捷键依赖焦点上下文，浏览器环境不支持系统级全局热键，且按键监听必须避免劫持活动输入控件。","content":"MDN 官方文档明确说明：keydown 事件目标为当前具有焦点的元素（input、textarea、contentEditable 或 body/root），按键事件由焦点元素向上传播至 Document 与 Window。浏览器在后台或未获得焦点时无法捕获键盘事件，Web 应用无法实现操作系统级全局快捷键唤起。","scope":"technical.keyboard_focus_shortcut","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/keydown_event"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording keydown shortcut evidence","toolSummary":"Record keydown evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":122,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T09:47:20.872Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"规划阶段自动化容器环境不可用，性能与兼容性测试必须在开发实施阶段的前置验证任务中真实执行，不能将未经实测的指标标记为通过。","content":"规划环境调用 environment_prepare 准备 Node 容器测试环境返回 unavailable：failed to connect to the docker API at npipe:////./pipe/dockerDesktopLinuxEngine; Docker 守护进程未启动。沙盒容器基准测试在当前规划环境无法执行。依据不可变证据契约，实测指标（1000条检索P95<=150ms、TTI<=1s、Safari真机验证）必须如实标记为 unexecuted，移交后续工程开发阶段的前置验证任务执行。","scope":"experiment.docker_env_status","source":"experiment:prepare-a6175a95-21c0-4968-b0ae-5fcdc9023684"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording environment prepare evidence","toolSummary":"Record docker env evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":124,"imagePath":null}
